c608\uc81c.md</code>\uc5d0\uc11c \ub2e4\ub8ec\ub2e4. \uc774 \ubb38\uc11c\ub294 \ud55c \ub2e8\uacc4 \ub354 \ub4e4\uc5b4\uac00\uc11c ECMAScript \uc2a4\ud399\uc774 \uc815\uc758\ud558\ub294 \ub0b4\ubd80 \ub3d9\uc791, \ucf5c\ubc31 \uc2dc\uadf8\ub2c8\ucc98\uc5d0 \uc228\uc740 \ud568\uc815, <code>break</code>\uac00 \uc548 \ub418\ub294 \uc9c4\uc9dc \uc774\uc720, s...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-10T09:50:45+00:00", "date_published": "2026-07-03T07:06:21+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Language/JavaScript/01_%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8_JavaScript/Map/Map/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Language/JavaScript/01_%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8_JavaScript/Map/Map/", "title": "JavaScript Map vs find vs filter \uc131\ub2a5 \ube44\uad50", "content_html": "<h1>JavaScript Map vs find() vs filter() \uc131\ub2a5 \ube44\uad50</h1>\n<h2>\ubc30\uacbd</h2>\n<p>JavaScript\uc5d0\uc11c \ub370\uc774\ud130\ub97c \uac80\uc0c9\ud558\uace0 \uad00\ub9ac\ud560 \ub54c \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \uc8fc\uc694 \ubc29\ubc95\ub4e4 \uc911 \ud558\ub098\uac00 <code>Map</code> \uac1d\uccb4\uc640 \ubc30\uc5f4\uc758 <code>find()</code>, <code>filter()</code> \uba54\uc11c\ub4dc\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uac01\uac01\uc740 \uc11c\ub85c \ub2e4\ub978 ...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-10T09:50:45+00:00", "date_published": "2026-07-03T07:06:21+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Language/JavaScript/09_ES6_%EB%B0%8F_%EA%B3%A0%EA%B8%89%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95/Base64_Encode_URI_Component_URL_Search_Params/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Language/JavaScript/09_ES6_%EB%B0%8F_%EA%B3%A0%EA%B8%89%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95/Base64_Encode_URI_Component_URL_Search_Params/", "title": "Base64 \u00b7 encodeURIComponent \u00b7 URLSearchParams", "content_html": "<h1>Base64\u00b7encodeURI\u00b7URLSearchParams \ube44\uad50</h1>\n<h2>\uc774 \ubb38\uc11c\uc758 \ubc94\uc704</h2>\n<p>\uac01 \ub3c4\uad6c\uc758 \uc0c1\uc138\ub294 \ub2e4\ub978 \ubb38\uc11c\uc5d0 \uc774\ubbf8 \uc788\ub2e4. Base64\uc758 \ubb38\uc790\uc14b/\ud328\ub529/\ubcc0\ud615\uc740 [Base64 \uc778\ucf54\ub529](../../../DataBase/DataRepresentation/Encoding/Bas...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-10T09:50:45+00:00", "date_published": "2026-07-03T07:06:21+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Language/JavaScript/10_%EC%9B%B9_%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C_%EB%B0%8F_%EB%B3%B4%EC%95%88/pbkdf2/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Language/JavaScript/10_%EC%9B%B9_%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C_%EB%B0%8F_%EB%B3%B4%EC%95%88/pbkdf2/", "title": "PBKDF2", "content_html": "<h1>PBKDF2 \u2014 \ube44\ubc00\ubc88\ud638 \ud0a4 \uc720\ub3c4 \ud568\uc218</h1>\n<h2>\ubc30\uacbd</h2>\n<p>PBKDF2(Password-Based Key Derivation Function 2)\ub294 \ube44\ubc00\ubc88\ud638\ub97c \uc548\uc804\ud558\uac8c \uc800\uc7a5\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud55c \uc554\ud638\ud654 \ud45c\uc900\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. RSA Security\uac00 2000\ub144 RFC 2898\uc5d0\uc11c \ucc98\uc74c \ubc1c\ud45c\ud588\uc73c\uba70, \ud604\uc7ac\uae4c\uc9c0...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-10T09:50:45+00:00", "date_published": "2026-07-03T07:06:21+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Network/IO/Socket_IO_Multiplexing/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Network/IO/Socket_IO_Multiplexing/", "title": "\uc18c\ucf13 I/O \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub809\uc2f1 \uc2ec\ud654", "content_html": "<h1>\uc18c\ucf13 I/O \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub809\uc2f1 \uc2ec\ud654</h1>\n<h2>I/O \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub809\uc2f1\uc774 \uc65c \ud544\uc694\ud55c\uac00</h2>\n<p>\uc11c\ubc84\uac00 \ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8 \ud55c \uba85\ub9cc \ubc1b\ub294\ub2e4\uba74 \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub809\uc2f1\uc740 \ud544\uc694 \uc5c6\ub2e4. <code>accept()</code> \ud558\uace0 <code>read()</code> \ud558\uace0 <code>write()</code> \ud558\uba74 \ub05d\uc774\ub2e4. \ubb38\uc81c\ub294 \ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\uac00 100\uba85, 1000\uba85, 10\ub9cc \uba85\uc774 \ub420 \ub54c \uc2dc\uc791\ub41c\ub2e4...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-10T09:50:45+00:00", "date_published": "2026-07-03T07:06:21+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Cloud/AWS/Network/Internet_Gateway/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Cloud/AWS/Network/Internet_Gateway/", "title": "Internet Gateway", "content_html": "<h1>AWS Internet Gateway</h1>\n<p>VPC\uc640 \uc778\ud130\ub137 \uc0ac\uc774\uc758 \uc720\uc77c\ud55c \uad00\ubb38\uc774\ub2e4. ALB\uac00 \uc678\ubd80 \ud2b8\ub798\ud53d\uc744 \ubc1b\ub294 \uac83\ub3c4, ECS Task\uac00 \uc678\ubd80 API\ub97c \ud638\ucd9c\ud558\ub294 \uac83\ub3c4 \uacb0\uad6d IGW\ub97c \uac70\uce5c\ub2e4. \uc124\uc815 \uc790\uccb4\ub294 VPC\uc5d0 \ubd99\uc774\uace0 \ub77c\uc6b0\ud305 \ud14c\uc774\ube14\uc5d0 \ucd94\uac00\ud558\ub294 \uac8c \uc804\ubd80\uc9c0\ub9cc, \uc5b4\ub290 \uc11c\ube0c\ub137\uc774 \ud37c\ube14\ub9ad\uc774\uc5b4...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-10T05:52:41+00:00", "date_published": "2026-08-10T03:18:06+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Cloud/AWS/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/Cloud/AWS/", "title": "AWS \uc804\uccb4 \ubcf4\uae30", "content_html": "<!-- AUTO-SECTION-INDEX: tools/section_index.py \uac00 \ube4c\ub4dc\ub9c8\ub2e4 \ub2e4\uc2dc \ub9cc\ub4e0\ub2e4. \uc9c1\uc811 \uace0\uce58\uc9c0 \ub9d0 \uac83. -->\n\n<h1>AWS \uc804\uccb4 \ubcf4\uae30</h1>\n<p>\ubb38\uc11c 182\uac1c.</p>\n<h2>AI</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"AI/Bedrock.md\">Amazon Bedrock</a></li>\n<li>[Amazon Q](...</li>\n</ul>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-10T03:18:06+00:00", "date_published": "2026-08-09T10:22:58+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/", "title": "YGSTUDY", "content_html": "<div class=\"yg-home\" markdown=\"0\">\n\n<section class=\"yg-section yg-about yg-about--hero\">\n  <div cla